    "summary": "Spec 35 step 2a (Decision 142). Every other key of a unit's loose and fleeing entries is now a column of the unit store: `next`, `goal` (`GOAL_FOE`/`GOAL_SLOT`), `foe_at`, `touch`, `toward`, `stuck`, `closest`, `along`, `caught`, `held_by` and `fanned`. A `KEYS` column records which keys each entry holds (`EntryKeys`), so the digest rebuilds the old dictionaries byte for byte. `squad.loose` and `squad.fleeing` now map each unit's id to the unit, in the order each entry was given.",
    "title": "feat(formation): the loose and fleeing entries' keys live in the unit store"
